Misa patches POSIX export/readonly parsing and adds session last-status and explicit $0 APIs.
Misa also patches POSIX directory and variable semantics (cd -L/-P and CDPATH,
exported PWD/OLDPWD, readonly unset, export/readonly listings); the patched
files are recorded in SOURCE.json.
Misa S08 patches quoting and expansion: IFS empty fields and positionals, UTF-8
IFS joining, escaped glob quoting, lazy parameter words, integer arithmetic
bases/truth/short-circuiting, and nonzero expansion-error status. See the
posix-expansion patch in SOURCE.json and native internal/shell/session tests.
